# HTML to Markdown

`htmlToMarkdown()` in `src/shared.tsx` uses TurndownService with custom rules for Tiptap-specific elements:

- Task items and task lists
- Callouts, collapsibles
- Link preview cards
- Strikethrough, highlight

When the Arca task editor gains a new extension or HTML output changes, update **both**:

1. `arca-server/src/utils/html-to-md.ts` (reference implementation)
2. `src/shared.tsx` `htmlToMarkdown()` (this file)

Supported HTML patterns are documented at the top of `arca-server/src/utils/html-to-md.ts`.
